    "image_with_text_dbkPVR": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_iR68QF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Die Cutting Service Offerings",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_h8bE9M": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Sheeting</li><li>Perforating</li><li>Slitting</li><li>Scoring</li><li>Kiss cutting</li><li>Bi-level cutting</li><li>Serrating</li><li>Pin feeding</li></ul><h4>Custom Material Converting Services</h4><p>Many industries may require slitting, cutting, or roll-winding. NADCO provides custom converting services designed specifically to meet these needs.</p><p>We can slit any material, regardless of the adhesive used, to your desired specifications, and we also convert adhesive tape materials. Our in-house equipment handles basic and complex converting procedures without sacrificing product quality. What’s more, we offer specialty slitting and rewinding services for jumbo rolls that allow clients to customize roll lengths.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_iR68QF",
        "text_h8bE9M"
      ],
