      }
    },
    "image_with_text_nFPUNg": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_pqaxDL": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials We Use",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Hf8mU3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Vinyl for accident-prone locations</li><li>Grit safety tapes that reduce the risk of falling and slipping on ladders, stairs, and ramps</li><li>Glo Brite safety track tapes, a glow-in-the-dark tape that provides nonslip protection on hazardous surfaces</li><li>Yellow- and black-striped anti-slip grit tapes</li><li><a href=\"/pages/foam-tape\" title=\"Foam Tape\">Foam tapes</a> including polyethylene double-coated foam tapes in both black and white</li><li><a href=\"/pages/foil-tape\" title=\"Foil Tape\">Foil tapes</a> made from aluminum, copper, and lead foil</li><li>And more! Feel free to inquire about the wealth of different materials NADCO works with</li></ul><h3>Quality Solutions at NADCO Tapes & Labels</h3><p>No matter your project’s size, we at NADCO are more than ready to tackle your challenges. If you would like to learn more about how working with NADCO will help take your organization to the next level, <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">contact</a> us and <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> today!</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
